---
import MissionLayout from '../../layouts/MissionLayout.astro';
---

<MissionLayout
  slug="mbfs-au"
  heading="Mercedes-Benz Financial Services Australia"
  status="Shipped / MVP"
  heroImage="/assets/projects/mb-thumbnail-2.avif"
  explorerGradient="linear-gradient(40deg, #141414 0%, #242424 100%)"
>
  <section class="case-section">
    <h2 class="case-section-title">1. The TL;DR <span class="case-section-sub">(Executive Summary)</span></h2>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">The Purpose</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">Help MBFS Australia customers manage their instalment payments through a new customer portal feature.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">The Problem</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">Customers had to call the customer service hotline or email to change payment details, increasing customer service and operations costs.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">The Solution &amp; Impact</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">The portal let customers update payment details, replan instalments, or request changes to their car finance plan themselves.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-section">
    <h2 class="case-section-title">2. Strategy &amp; Discovery</h2>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Insight</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">I analyzed customer feedback in the CRM to identify pain points and opportunities to improve the portal.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Stakeholders</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">I led research, design, and UX surveys, partnering with the Product Owner, lead developers, marketing, finance, and legal teams in Australia.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Supervisor (CPO)</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/robert-rabach/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Robert Rabach</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Constraint</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">The project required multiple legal and compliance approvals, plus careful alignment with banking system settings and APIs. The process was lengthy, but worthwhile.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-section">
    <h2 class="case-section-title">3. Execution <span class="case-section-sub">(The &ldquo;How&rdquo;)</span></h2>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Execution</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">I planned the research and design, analyzed CRM data, drafted the feature strategy, and developed low-fidelity concepts through multiple approval rounds. I then refined the high-fidelity UI to meet Mercedes-Benz design standards and gain HQ sign-off.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-section">
    <h2 class="case-section-title">4. Outcome &amp; Lessons</h2>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Impact</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">Within one month of launch, calls to customer service fell by 30%.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</MissionLayout>
